  "details": "Ever the since the scaling update, FBT on chairs no longer works. Normally to get FBT working on a chair, you had to do the following:\n\n1. Get in a chair with FBT (already calibrated)\n\n2. Go to the OSC and enable/disable it to trigger an avatar reload.\n\n3. You can now move your legs and move around while still sitting on the chair.\n\nBut now whenever I go to worlds and try this out, my avatar is forced to 3-point tracking on a chair. Does anyone else experience this issue? If so, are there any workarounds?",
